---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於吳奇老師"
  description="吳奇老師是一位致力於連結科技與人文的國文教師，AI教育先行者，透過數位敘事力期刊無私分享教育科技知識與實踐經驗。"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-20">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-500 via-primary-600 to-secondary-600 text-white overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
        <div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-64 h-64 bg-white rounded-full filter blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-300 rounded-full filter blur-3xl"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">
            AI教育先行者：吳奇老師的創新教學之路
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/90">
            一位連結科技與人文的國文老師
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            在教育創新的浪潮中，有這樣一位國文老師，他不僅在課堂上傳授文學之美，
            更走在時代前端，將AI人工智慧的強大能量注入教學實踐。他就是<strong class="text-primary-600">吳奇老師</strong>——一位致力於連結科技與人文，
            並透過經營「數位敘事力期刊」社群，無私分享AI工具與教育洞見，啟發廣大教育工作者的先行者。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Learning Journey -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
            學思歷程
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
            從華語文學到AI科技的跨界整合
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="prose prose-lg">
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                吳奇老師的跨域整合能力，源自一段目標清晰且持續精進的學思歷程。
                這一切始於高中時期的一次國際交流經驗，那次經歷讓他深刻體認到中文在全球的價值與魅力，
                這份啟發也促使他在大學時選擇進入<strong class="text-primary-600">中原大學應用華語文學系</strong>，
                為日後的華語文教學之路埋下種子。
              </p>

              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                大學期間，他不僅修習了「漢語語言學」等專業課程，更主動接觸「資訊處理」相關知識，
                並完成了中等教育學程的研修，這些看似不同的學習板塊，
                為他日後結合語文專業與數位科技的教學模式，奠定了扎實的跨領域基礎。
              </p>

              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                畢業後，他隨即受實習學校（<strong class="text-primary-600">桃園市大華中學</strong>）邀請留校服務，
                成為一名專任國文教師，然而他的學習並未就此停歇，
                而是同時攻讀<strong class="text-primary-600">台灣師範大學的華語文教學研究所</strong>，
                展現了其不斷精進、追求卓越的熱忱。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">學歷與認證</h3>
              <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z" />
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">國立台灣師範大學</div>
                    <div class="text-gray-600">華語文教學研究所</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">在讀</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">中原大學</div>
                    <div class="text-gray-600">應用華語文學系</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-primary-600">傑出系友</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="border-t pt-6">
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">專業認證</h4>
                  <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">Google Certified Trainer</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">MagicSchool AI Certified Trainer</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">ViewSonic 領航講師</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">Gemini Academy 教育工作者認證</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">中等學校國文科教師證</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class="text-gray-700">對外華語教學能力證明</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Philosophy -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
            核心理念
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
            AI時代下教師角色的再定義
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Philosophy 1 -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-8 animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              教師角色的轉變
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              AI無法取代教師在情感引導與關懷上的獨特角色，但教師的工作性質正在改變。
              教師需要從過去單純的「知識傳授者」，轉變為學習的「引導者與輔助者」。
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Philosophy 2 -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-green-100 rounded-2xl p-8 animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-green-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              教育生態系的共學觀
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              教育的成功並非僅靠學校單方面努力，而是需要學校、家庭與社會三方的共同協作。
              一個健康的教育生態系，需要所有持份者共同努力。
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Philosophy 3 -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-purple-100 rounded-2xl p-8 animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              超越工具的本質思考
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              教育者不應停留在討論「哪個AI工具比較好用」的層次，而應思考：
              這個工具如何優化教學流程？如何提升學生的學習體驗？
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Digital Narrative Journal -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 text-primary-600 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-4">
              社群平台
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
              數位敘事力期刊
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              一間為所有教育者開放的數位教室
            </p>

            <div class="prose prose-lg">
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                為了將理念付諸實踐並與更多人分享，吳奇老師創辦了「數位敘事力期刊」，
                一個始於Instagram，後續擴展至Facebook與YouTube的平台。
                其核心目標非常明確：<strong class="text-primary-600">系統性地分享最新的AI教育工具、前瞻觀點與實際應用方法</strong>，
                成為所有教育工作者的數位智庫。
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">涵蓋主題</h4>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">AI備課平台</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">AI筆記管理</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">多媒體創作</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">AI Agents</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">AI素養倫理</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-gray-700">教學實踐</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-secondary-500 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white">
              <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">追蹤我們的社群</h3>
              <p class="text-white/90 mb-8">
                透過這個平台，吳奇老師將個人的探索轉化為社群的共學資源，
                讓每位老師都能在這間開放的數位教室中，找到適合自己的AI教學解決方案。
              </p>

              <div class="space-y-4">
                <a
                  href="https://www.instagram.com/journal_of_digital_narrative/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-lg transition-colors group"
                >
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="font-semibold">Instagram</span>
                  </div>
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
                  </svg>
                </a>

                <a
                  href="https://www.facebook.com/數位敘事力期刊Journal-of-Digital-Narrative"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-lg transition-colors group"
                >
                  <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="font-semibold">Facebook</span>
                  </div>
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Achievements -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
            一位活躍的分享者
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
            啟發下一波教育浪潮
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 rounded-2xl animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4">100+</div>
            <div class="text-gray-700 font-medium">場演講與工作坊</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">遍及全台各級學校</p>
          </div>

